{"id": "60582", "title": "蔷薇", "author": "爱枣", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 22, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/60/60582.htm", "intro": "男人粗长的巨物在雪白的圆臀间抽插着，“嗯…”一声声娇喘从粉嫩的唇间溢出，感觉到体内的灼热更加的坚硬，变得更粗更长。\r\n一双大手将我翻了个身，变成後背式，期间，巨物一直没有离开体内，热热的，不安好心的乱动这。我无力的趴在柔软的丝绸床单上，倒吸一口冷气，觉得小穴里泛起一阵酥麻。", "base": "files/article/html/60/60582", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "8896806.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "8896808.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-20", "file": "8896810.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-30", "file": "8896812.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-40", "file": "8896814.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-50", "file": "8896816.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-60", "file": "8896819.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-70", "file": "8896821.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-80", "file": "8896823.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81-90", "file": "8896830.html", "available": false}, {"title": "91-95", "file": "8896832.html", "available": false}, {"title": "96-100", "file": "8896834.html", "available": false}, {"title": "101-105", "file": "8896836.html", "available": false}, {"title": "106-110", "file": "8896838.html", "available": false}, {"title": "111-115", "file": "8896840.html", "available": false}, {"title": "116-120", "file": "8896842.html", "available": false}, {"title": "121-130", "file": "8896845.html", "available": false}, {"title": "121-130", "file": "8896851.html", "available": false}, {"title": "141-150", "file": "8896854.html", "available": false}, {"title": "151-160", "file": "8896855.html", "available": false}, {"title": "161-170", "file": "8896857.html", "available": false}, {"title": "171-173", "file": "8896859.html", "available": false}]}